WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.328
Across construction, giga projects, manufacturing,

00:00:04.611 --> 00:00:08.888
operations and other high-hazard industries, the same questions matter.

00:00:09.278 --> 00:00:10.896
What are we required to do?

00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:13.485
Does our management system provide for it?

00:00:13.748 --> 00:00:16.016
And is it happening where the work takes place?

00:00:16.407 --> 00:00:18.872
Veriso Platform connects those questions.

00:00:19.193 --> 00:00:23.678
It turns information, requirements and field evidence into a continuous

00:00:23.698 --> 00:00:28.357
cycle of learning, action and verification, with the scope matched to

00:00:28.377 --> 00:00:30.406
the hazards and work involved.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.684
The architecture brings company information in, assesses it against the

00:00:34.704 --> 00:00:37.517
requirements that apply, and maps the gaps.

00:00:38.001 --> 00:00:41.917
It then produces the changes, training and improvement actions in the

00:00:41.937 --> 00:00:43.914
organisation's own way of working.

00:00:44.398 --> 00:00:46.457
Field observations test the result.

00:00:46.848 --> 00:00:50.404
Leadership uses that evidence to set a North Star, strategy and

00:00:50.424 --> 00:00:53.870
roadmap, and the next cycle begins with a clearer picture.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:58.824
Start with the material already used to run the organisation: policies,

00:00:58.898 --> 00:01:03.058
procedures, forms, risk assessments, training

00:01:03.078 --> 00:01:07.981
records, permits, maintenance information and incident records.

00:01:08.465 --> 00:01:11.823
Reviewed scans and photographs can bring older material into the picture

00:01:11.843 --> 00:01:16.433
too. Veriso builds an inventory and system profile, preserving

00:01:16.453 --> 00:01:21.193
sources, versions, terminology, document structure and

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:23.672
the organisation's own working language.

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:27.175
The comparison is built around the organisation's context.

00:01:27.566 --> 00:01:32.283
Country-specific legal and regulatory requirements sit alongside applicable

00:01:32.303 --> 00:01:37.171
codes, standards, client conditions, lender requirements and

00:01:37.191 --> 00:01:41.885
company commitments. The organisation's own methods, responsibilities and

00:01:41.905 --> 00:01:44.823
approved controls remain part of the picture.

00:01:45.399 --> 00:01:49.923
Applicability is established for the jurisdiction, activity and scope,

00:01:50.264 --> 00:01:53.141
so the assessment is grounded in what actually applies.

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:57.056
Veriso analyses the material and produces a linked gap map.

00:01:57.319 --> 00:02:01.816
It shows where a requirement is addressed, partly addressed, missing or

00:02:01.836 --> 00:02:05.996
contradicted, and where a control exists only on paper.

00:02:06.689 --> 00:02:10.396
Every gap points back to the requirement and the relevant source.

00:02:10.973 --> 00:02:13.906
Teams can see what needs to change in their own system,

00:02:14.131 --> 00:02:17.368
with the basis for each proposed finding available to review.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.344
The second comparison is with ground truth.

00:02:20.735 --> 00:02:23.618
A procedure may be complete while the control is absent in

00:02:23.638 --> 00:02:27.472
practice. A team may also be doing useful work that its

00:02:27.492 --> 00:02:29.133
system fails to capture.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:34.067
Veriso keeps required controls, documented provision and observed practice

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:38.111
distinct. Their differences show whether the problem is missing design,

00:02:38.394 --> 00:02:42.885
unclear direction, poor implementation or insufficient evidence.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:47.361
Leadership sets the North Star: the outcomes the organisation is trying

00:02:47.381 --> 00:02:51.309
to achieve. Veriso connects that direction to the evidence.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:56.514
It orders gaps and improvement priorities by consequence, requirements,

00:02:56.623 --> 00:02:59.796
dependencies and what remains unverified.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.060
Strategy becomes a roadmap.

00:03:02.451 --> 00:03:07.168
The roadmap becomes practical plans, named owners, actions and

00:03:07.188 --> 00:03:11.208
review dates, with local routes that support the same organisational

00:03:11.228 --> 00:03:11.992
direction.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:15.912
The platform produces the response in the organisation's own structure and

00:03:15.932 --> 00:03:20.638
format. It drafts tracked changes to existing procedures, creates missing

00:03:20.658 --> 00:03:24.202
documents and recommends improvements to the information captured in

00:03:24.222 --> 00:03:28.834
existing systems. Terminology, roles, templates and

00:03:28.854 --> 00:03:31.064
house style follow the company profile.

00:03:31.548 --> 00:03:35.069
Each proposed change is connected to the gap it addresses and

00:03:35.089 --> 00:03:36.573
the requirement behind it.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:39.416
The responsible owner reviews what has been produced.

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.945
They can accept it, edit it or reject it with a

00:03:42.965 --> 00:03:46.870
recorded reason. The decision stays connected to the original gap.

00:03:47.261 --> 00:03:51.398
Accepted changes enter the organisation's controlled adoption process.

00:03:51.789 --> 00:03:55.774
Rejected or unresolved items stay visible, so a convincing piece of

00:03:55.794 --> 00:03:59.891
writing cannot silently close a real management-system weakness.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:04.528
From accepted changes, Veriso prepares role-specific training programmes:

00:04:04.753 --> 00:04:09.586
briefings, toolbox talks, learning material and checks of understanding.

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:13.022
The organisation reviews and adopts that material through the same

00:04:13.042 --> 00:04:17.585
controlled process, then uses its existing learning system to deliver it.

00:04:17.976 --> 00:04:20.975
People receive an explanation of what has changed and what they

00:04:20.995 --> 00:04:21.777
need to do.

00:04:22.098 --> 00:04:26.234
Completion is recorded, while competence and performance still require

00:04:26.254 --> 00:04:27.669
appropriate evidence.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.810
The next step happens where the work takes place.

00:04:31.294 --> 00:04:35.500
On a construction project, that includes work at height, the interface

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:40.249
between mobile plant and pedestrians, confined space work and excavation.

00:04:40.942 --> 00:04:44.358
A competent observer uses the prescribed test for the control and

00:04:44.378 --> 00:04:48.863
records what was found, with its evidence, context and the observer's

00:04:48.883 --> 00:04:53.623
role. The same evidence method applies across sectors, using the controls

00:04:53.643 --> 00:04:55.214
relevant to each activity.

00:04:55.605 --> 00:04:59.408
A revised procedure, delivered training and a control observed in practice

00:04:59.459 --> 00:05:00.607
remain distinct.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:04.873
AI assists with reading, drafting and explanation.

00:05:05.357 --> 00:05:08.495
Assurance results come from the governing rules applied to sufficient

00:05:08.515 --> 00:05:12.814
admissible observations. The result can be traced to its evidence, the

00:05:12.834 --> 00:05:15.299
rule version and the time it was assessed.

00:05:15.783 --> 00:05:18.492
Sealed records make later alteration evident.

00:05:18.813 --> 00:05:22.013
They preserve the basis of the conclusion while leaving the quality

00:05:22.064 --> 00:05:25.406
and sufficiency of the evidence open to examination.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:28.256
The same record supports different decisions.

00:05:28.578 --> 00:05:30.660
A site team sees what needs action.

00:05:31.051 --> 00:05:33.458
Functional leaders see patterns and coverage.

00:05:33.779 --> 00:05:38.136
The board sees significant gaps, carried risk and decisions requiring

00:05:38.156 --> 00:05:42.351
ownership. Authorised stakeholders can examine the relevant evidence.

00:05:42.614 --> 00:05:46.473
Counts show their totals, and serious deficiencies remain visible.

00:05:47.049 --> 00:05:50.895
The result is a shared basis for decisions without hiding uncertainty

00:05:50.915 --> 00:05:52.806
inside one overall score.

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:55.970
Six modules apply the approach to different questions.

00:05:56.233 --> 00:05:59.685
Qualify examines contractor capability before award.

00:06:00.262 --> 00:06:02.622
Ready checks the conditions for the first task.

00:06:03.106 --> 00:06:05.850
Control examines critical controls during work.

00:06:06.171 --> 00:06:09.182
Process addresses assurance of major-accident barriers.

00:06:09.759 --> 00:06:13.024
Social and Welfare covers workers' conditions across their employment

00:06:13.044 --> 00:06:16.565
journey. Environment addresses the controls behind environmental

00:06:16.585 --> 00:06:20.640
commitments. Organisations select the scope they need while keeping a common

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:21.715
evidence method.

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:26.584
The cycle continues as requirements change, work changes and new

00:06:26.604 --> 00:06:30.904
evidence arrives. Gaps reopen when their basis no longer holds.

00:06:31.225 --> 00:06:35.326
The organisation learns from recurring findings, adjusts its strategy and

00:06:35.346 --> 00:06:36.674
updates the roadmap.

00:06:37.158 --> 00:06:41.124
Veriso connects reading, measurement, ground truth,

00:06:41.349 --> 00:06:45.996
direction, improvement, checking and reporting into one repeatable

00:06:46.016 --> 00:06:49.734
cycle. Each pass improves the picture of the system and the

00:06:49.754 --> 00:06:51.819
reality it is meant to support.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:56.502
Veriso Platform connects what is required, what your system provides and

00:06:56.522 --> 00:06:57.977
what happens in practice.

00:06:58.298 --> 00:07:01.239
It helps you find the gaps, build the response in your

00:07:01.259 --> 00:07:05.233
own format, prepare your people and verify the result.

00:07:05.717 --> 00:07:08.901
With a North Star and a practical route to improvement, the

00:07:08.921 --> 00:07:11.781
organisation gains more than another set of documents.

00:07:12.103 --> 00:07:14.457
It gains a system that can learn from the work.
